                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw-tab-3')">Invoice</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw-tab-4')">Packages</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 maxwr-15" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw-tab-5')">Deliveries and returns</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pa-tabs__content">
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel pa-tabs__panel--active" id="rw-tab-1"><h4>User</h4><p>Account holder details.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw-tab-2"><h4>Order</h4><p>Order summary and line items.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw-tab-3"><h4>Invoice</h4><p>Billing and payment status.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw-tab-4"><h4>Packages</h4><p>Parcels in this shipment.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw-tab-5"><h4>Deliveries and returns</h4><p>Tracking, delivery attempts and returns &mdash; the long tab wraps to two lines while the short tabs hold their 8rem floor and stretch to match its height.</p></div>
                    </div>

                    <h4 style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Prefer one line? Drop <code>--wrap-labels</code> and let the long tab grow past the floor</h4>
                    <div class="pa-tabs">
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 pa-tabs__item--active" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw1-tab-1')">User</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw1-tab-2')">Order</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw1-tab-3')">Invoice</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw1-tab-4')">Packages</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rw1-tab-5')">Deliveries and returns</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pa-tabs__content">
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel pa-tabs__panel--active" id="rw1-tab-1"><p>Same 8rem floor, no cap &mdash; the four short tabs are uniform and only &ldquo;Deliveries and returns&rdquo; grows to fit its text.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw1-tab-2"><p>Order.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw1-tab-3"><p>Invoice.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw1-tab-4"><p>Packages.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rw1-tab-5"><p>Deliveries and returns.</p></div>
                    </div>

                    <h4 style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Center the label inside each tab &mdash; add <code>justify-content-center</code> to the item</h4>
                    <div class="pa-tabs pa-tabs--wrap-labels">
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 justify-content-center pa-tabs__item--active" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rwc-tab-1')">User</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 justify-content-center" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rwc-tab-2')">Order</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 justify-content-center" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rwc-tab-3')">Invoice</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 justify-content-center" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rwc-tab-4')">Packages</button>
                        <button class="pa-tabs__item minwr-8 maxwr-15 justify-content-center" onclick="switchTab(this, 'rwc-tab-5')">Deliveries and returns</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pa-tabs__content">
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel pa-tabs__panel--active" id="rwc-tab-1"><p>Same floored tabs, but the label is centered within each tab instead of start-aligned.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rwc-tab-2"><p>Order.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rwc-tab-3"><p>Invoice.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rwc-tab-4"><p>Packages.</p></div>
                        <div class="pa-tabs__panel" id="rwc-tab-5"><p>Deliveries and returns.</p></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pa-alert pa-alert--info" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                        <strong>Note:</strong> when a tab is wider than its text (via <code>minwr-*</code>/<code>wr-*</code>),
                        the label is <em>start-aligned</em> by default. Add the <code>justify-content-center</code> utility
                        &mdash; the tab item is a flexbox &mdash; to center it (or <code>justify-content-end</code> to
                        end-align). That utility ships in <code>@keenmate/pure-css</code>. It is <em>not</em> the same as
                        <code>pa-tabs--centered</code>, which centers the whole tab group within the bar rather than the
                        label inside each tab.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

